Package: nekohub
Version: 0.11.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nekoHub contributors
Depends: nekohub-agent (= 0.11.0), openssh-client, sshpass
Homepage: https://github.com/awakyy1/nekohub
Description: Linux fleet management designed for the terminal
 nekoHub is a terminal interface for monitoring Linux machines through the
 native nekoHub agent. OpenSSH remains available for inventory and operations.
